# Test fixtures are DATA: their bytes are part of the assertion. Windows
# checkouts default to CRLF, which silently breaks tests that build an edit by
# string-replacing LF-delimited snippets (the replace finds nothing, the "edit"
# equals the base, and the verdict degrades to UNPROVEN on every platform-
# specific run). Pin them to LF everywhere.
tests/fixtures/** text eol=lf
